{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>They sank</b> — three times in the Masorah: here, and the others: \"at the sound [they sank], O lips\" (Isaiah 41:7), and \"when the gates of Jerusalem sank\" (Nehemiah 3:3, 15). To teach that He brought upon Egypt sounds and sword — sounds, as written \"at the sound [they sank], O sword\"; what is the sinking there? As written, \"if you alter, I will send a hand against you\" — so too here, sounds and sword."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:13:02.575354625Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}